OWASP BLT monorepo: licensing notice

This repository holds many separately licensed projects. There is no single licence for the whole
repository. Each project folder carries its own LICENSE file, and that file governs the folder's contents.

  Most projects:   GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
                   https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html
  Exceptions:      blt-leaf/     MIT License
                   blt-lettuce/  GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
  No LICENSE yet:  blt-autopatch/, blt-cli/, blt-cron/, blt-gsoc/, blt-hackerhouse/, blt-mayo/
                   Ask the project leaders before reusing code from these folders.

Always check the LICENSE file in the folder you use or change. Contributions to a folder are made under
that folder's licence.

Files outside the project folders (scripts/, docs/, .forkmesh/ and the root documents) do not yet have a
declared licence.
